    "body": "Quick pass done on f122474d.\n- Merges cleanly with main; upstream main 23c62044 is in the branch, and nothing newer has landed.\n- `cargo xtask gate batch` on c770b35c: every test suite green. Clippy is clean on the head (`cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`). Pinning suites rerun on the head: `thread_mill_rim` (6) and `crossing_retrace` (2), green.\n- The body is complete: what changed, how it was tested, what was not exercised, `Changelog:`, `Fixes #1071`.\n- Laws: no `unwrap`/`expect`/`panic!` outside tests, no snapshot PNG touched, the new module carries a provenance line, the touched files are under 400 lines (`generate.rs` was already over, +11 lines here), and there is a decision file.\n\nFlagging ready for review. This changes the gouge, solid and crossing laws, and the crossing change reaches every operation's verify, so per the effort table the review should run at the high tier.",
